# T65 play-query (plan 2026-10-25-m3-library.md, Phase 2, I150). Run with the
# working directory set to build/host/tests/songs and
# `--catalogue tests/m3/catalogue.tsv`. Directives (script-only):
#   @results          print RESULTS n key,key,... of the last search
#   @library_stats    print LIBRARY searches=N fts_queries=N songs_opened=N
# The saved view and the inline query it stands for return the same keys.
LIBRARY_SEARCH format:mod
@results
PLAY_QUERY format:mod
@queue
QUEUE_ADD_QUERY format:xm
@queue
VIEW_SAVE xmfans format:xm
LIBRARY_SEARCH view:xmfans
@results
LIBRARY_SEARCH format:xm
@results
LIBRARY_SEARCH view:nosuchview
LIBRARY_SEARCH nosuchword
@results
VIEW_SOURCE query
@library_stats
